  ('4d032a65-8670-55a4-b983-3757ed095ce2'::uuid, 'ff681dc2-bc62-4934-b936-49af1da4af6c', 'Animist''s Awakening', 'https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/f/f/ff681dc2-bc62-4934-b936-49af1da4af6c.jpg', '{X}{G}', 'Sorcery', ARRAY['G']::text[], ARRAY['G']::text[], 'Reveal the top X cards of your library. Put all land cards from among them onto the battlefield tapped and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.
