  ('45b041d4-7e49-5c6f-9e62-ffa98b2c9ca9'::uuid, 'dc922e89-c816-476a-82c3-3c6b9fd196a9', 'Apex of Power', 'https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/d/c/dc922e89-c816-476a-82c3-3c6b9fd196a9.jpg', '{7}{R}{R}{R}', 'Sorcery', ARRAY['R']::text[], ARRAY['R']::text[], 'Exile the top seven cards of your library. Until end of turn, you may cast spells from among them.
